{
    "title": "Wedding Invitation Card Maker",
    "description": "<h1>Invitation maker for weddings!</h1>\r\nWith this incredible wedding card maker, you can create beautiful wedding card designs. Wedding invitation card maker has a huge collection of pre-made templates that you can easily modify for your special day! \ud83d\udc70\r\n\r\nMake your wedding invitation unique and breathtaking with the wedding card maker. Creating greeting cards has never been easier with wedding invitation maker templates!\r\n\r\nAdd your special date, change the names and colors and send your greeting cards to your closest friends and family with the wedding invitation maker!\u2728\r\n\r\n<b>Different wedding invitation maker styles</b>\r\n\u2728 Classy wedding greeting cards;\r\n\u2728 Minimal invitation maker templates;\r\n\u2728 Traditional party invitation cards;\r\n\u2728 Modern greeting cards;\r\n\u2728 Romantic card design looks.\r\n\r\n<h2>Free Wedding Invitation Templates!</h2>\r\n<b>Easy personalization - Wedding card maker</b>\ud83d\udc92\r\nWith the wedding invitation maker, you can quickly create save-the-date greeting cards with all your information. The wedding invitation maker has a collection of templates to choose from, which you can customize. Change the dates and names, replace the colors and details on the card design and send it to your guests.\r\n\r\nThis invitation card maker app helps you design breathtaking card designs. You already have enough on your plate when planning a beautiful wedding. With the greeting cards app, you don't have to worry anymore.\r\n\r\n<h2>The easiest way to design perfect wedding invitation cards.</h2>\r\nThe party invitation card app has many types of save-the-date greeting cards. Beautiful flower frames, elegant colors, and stylish fonts are just some things the wedding invitation maker has in its collection.\r\n\r\n<b>Wedding card maker - Key features</b>\r\n\u2b50Stylish card designs;\r\n\u2b50Beautiful fonts;\r\n\u2b50Creative greeting cards;\r\n\u2b50Stunning color palette;\r\n\u2b50Add your own photos.\r\n\r\n<b>Pre-made arrangement templates</b>\r\nThere is a collection of details and arrangements for your perfect wedding invitation. Choose from beautiful flower arrangements to elegant banners and cake pictures to make your party invitation card special!\r\n\r\n<b>Add your own photos with the wedding card maker app. </b>\ud83d\uddbc\r\nMake your party invitation card unique with a picture of you and your beloved. Add any photo you want, and tweak the opacity of it so you can use it as a beautiful background.\r\n\r\nUse the invitation card maker tool and make your own card design. We have all the tools you need to create the perfect party invitation card.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1>Invitation maker for weddings!</h1><br>With this incredible wedding card maker, you can create beautiful wedding card designs. Wedding invitation card maker has a huge collection of pre-made templates that you can easily modify for your special day! \ud83d\udc70<br><br>Make your wedding invitation unique and breathtaking with the wedding card maker. Creating greeting cards has never been easier with wedding invitation maker templates!<br><br>Add your special date, change the names and colors and send your greeting cards to your closest friends and family with the wedding invitation maker!\u2728<br><br><b>Different wedding invitation maker styles</b><br>\u2728 Classy wedding greeting cards;<br>\u2728 Minimal invitation maker templates;<br>\u2728 Traditional party invitation cards;<br>\u2728 Modern greeting cards;<br>\u2728 Romantic card design looks.<br><br><h2>Free Wedding Invitation Templates!</h2><br><b>Easy personalization - Wedding card maker</b>\ud83d\udc92<br>With the wedding invitation maker, you can quickly create save-the-date greeting cards with all your information. The wedding invitation maker has a collection of templates to choose from, which you can customize. Change the dates and names, replace the colors and details on the card design and send it to your guests.<br><br>This invitation card maker app helps you design breathtaking card designs. You already have enough on your plate when planning a beautiful wedding. With the greeting cards app, you don&#39;t have to worry anymore.<br><br><h2>The easiest way to design perfect wedding invitation cards.</h2><br>The party invitation card app has many types of save-the-date greeting cards. Beautiful flower frames, elegant colors, and stylish fonts are just some things the wedding invitation maker has in its collection.<br><br><b>Wedding card maker - Key features</b><br>\u2b50Stylish card designs;<br>\u2b50Beautiful fonts;<br>\u2b50Creative greeting cards;<br>\u2b50Stunning color palette;<br>\u2b50Add your own photos.<br><br><b>Pre-made arrangement templates</b><br>There is a collection of details and arrangements for your perfect wedding invitation. Choose from beautiful flower arrangements to elegant banners and cake pictures to make your party invitation card special!<br><br><b>Add your own photos with the wedding card maker app. </b>\ud83d\uddbc<br>Make your party invitation card unique with a picture of you and your beloved. Add any photo you want, and tweak the opacity of it so you can use it as a beautiful background.<br><br>Use the invitation card maker tool and make your own card design. We have all the tools you need to create the perfect party invitation card.",
